[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791493955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104813#issuecomment-2791493955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104813","id":2791493955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mYtFD","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T04:05:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T04:05:03Z","body":"This option can also be used for #105139. I agree to hide this option when size limit is 0 before #105139 is ready. However, after that its name should not be \"Size Limit Interpolation\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791493955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795562249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104813#issuecomment-2795562249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104813","id":2795562249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6moOUJ","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T00:56:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T00:56:43Z","body":"> However, after that its name should not be \"Size Limit Interpolation\".\r\n\r\n@beicause I had it as 'Resize algorithm' like Unity does, but I already made the changes as @Calinou requested.\r\nHow would you rename it?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795562249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824817579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104813#issuecomment-2824817579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104813","id":2824817579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oX0ur","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T16:08:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T16:08:25Z","body":"> > However, after that its name should not be \"Size Limit Interpolation\".\r\n> \r\n> @beicause I had it as 'Resize algorithm' like Unity does, but I already made the changes as @Calinou requested. How would you rename it?\r\n\r\nThere is a general question regarding the future of these sorts of resize algorithm parameters... Will each resize have its own algorithm or will one resize algorithm be used on multiple resizes?\r\n\r\n### Option 1 (multiple interpolation parameters):\r\n**Mipmaps**\r\n- Mipmaps Interpolation\r\n\r\n**Process**\r\n- Size Limit\r\n- Size Limit Interpolation\r\n- Resolution Scale\r\n- Resolution Scale Interpolation\r\n\r\n### Option 2 (single interpolation parameter):\r\n**Mipmaps**\r\n- (uses Process: Resize Interpolation setting)\r\n\r\n**Process**\r\n- Resize Interpolation\r\n- Size Limit\r\n- Resolution Scale\r\n\r\n### Option 3 (two interpolation parameters):\r\n**Mipmaps**\r\n- Mipmaps Interpolation\r\n\r\n**Process**\r\n- Resize Interpolation\r\n- Size Limit\r\n- Resolution Scale\r\n\r\n(\"Resolution Scale\" is a new import parameter introduced in #105139)\r\n\r\nOption 2 is a little awkward with the current Import panel because Resize Interpolation would apply to Mipmaps (which have their own heading) and Size Limit and Resolution Scale (which are under the Process heading).\r\n\r\nIs it possible that performance characteristics would favour one approach over the other? Would users want control over different algorithms for different settings?\r\n\r\nFrom a user experience perspective, I believe that I prefer Option 3, but I haven't thought too deeply about this yet.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824817579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501504038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104813#issuecomment-5501504038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104813","id":5501504038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR-pKJg","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T22:53:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:53:24Z","body":"I'm not going to continue with this PR anymore, so I'm going to close it. Sorry for the inconvenience.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5501504038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]